      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GRASSBURN (3) is a distance specialist who returned to form with a dominant victory over 1000m at Port Macquarie. Goes well on the home track and looks up to this tougher contest. STUPENDO (7) comes back in trip after he worked home well to grab second over 1200m at Canberra in a TAB Federal Open.  Tempo suits and will be savaging the line. PRATT (2) produced good figures with the 60.5kg for a surprise victory over 1008m at this track. Drops 4.5kg today and will be in this for a long way. VEECEE (6) handy sprinter resuming. Has a good record fresh and at this track and trip. Came from near last on the from the outside draw with a tidy fourth over 1005m at Grafton in a BM82. Stays in the mix.",
